- Android:
 Integrated Android support and Appium                 

- Threading:
 New keywords to send and receive notifications between threads are available.

 ``Send Thread Notification`` and
 
 ``Wait Thread Notification`` 

- DoIP:
 The documentation got an extension.

- robotLog2RQM
 Support of RQM behind SSO system.


